title: "DeepQC: Automated Blind MRI Quality Assessment with 3D CNNs"
abstract: >-
  Automated blind MRI quality assessment using a 3D CNN and fully-connected deep
  network. Trained on ABIDE-1 (15 sites) with strong transfer to novel sites and
  to Glioblastoma MRI from TCIA.
